<title>USA: Top Source Tech sees Q1 loss, profit in Q2.</title>
<headline>Top Source Tech sees Q1 loss, profit in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top Source Technologies Inc said on Monday that it expects to report a loss of about $0.03 a share for its first quarter ended December 31, 1996 and that it expects annualized profitability and positive cash flow from operations to begin in the second fiscal quarter.</p>
<p>Top Source reported a fourth quarter loss of $0.17 a share, compared with a loss of $0.08 a share for the previous fourth quarter.</p>
</text>
